-## Props
-
-### isBorderless
-
-Determines the border style of the card.
-
--   Type: `Boolean`
--   Required: No
--   Default: `false`
-
-### isElevated
-
-Determines the elevation style of the card.
-
--   Type: `Boolean`
--   Required: No
