-## Sub-Components
-
-This component provides a collection of sub-component that can be used to compose various interfaces.
-
--   [`<CardBody />`](./docs/body.md)
--   [`<CardDivider />`](./docs/divider.md)
--   [`<CardFooter />`](./docs/footer.md)
--   [`<CardHeader />`](./docs/header.md)
